{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8740-1",
  "summary": "dotnet8, dotnet10 vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Weeraphat Srisutham discovered that the .NET watch BrowserRefreshServer did\nnot properly validate cross-origin WebSocket connections. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to expose sensitive information. (CVE-2026-58649)\n\nRajesh Chada discovered that the .NET watch AspireServerService improperly\nexposed information through the use of certain arguments. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to elevate privileges and execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-69806)",
